          "title": "树莓派掌上电脑",
          "content": "<p>一支国外团队推出了“树莓派掌上电脑”，看上去很酷。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202412/bg2024120501.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>它就是一个全功能的 Linux 系统，带有7小时续航。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202412/bg2024120502.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>它还有一个可组装版本，屏幕是单独分离的。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202412/bg2024120505.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>下面可以配上键盘，也可以配上手柄。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202412/bg2024120503.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202412/bg2024120504.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>它是开源的，制作团队希望将成本控制在250美元。</p>",
